        "title": "Remove test directory from workspace",
        "summary": "Removes the `test` directory from the monorepo workspace configuration and deletes all associated mock data files. The `package.json` workspaces array drops the `test` entry, while `test/__mock-data__` containing action and app schemas is purged. This cleanup affects only the repository structure and internal test fixtures.",
