      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The project deleted a large folder (230,000+ lines across 1,500+ files) of old test data and removed it from the build's workspace settings, so the test fixtures used internally during development no longer exist. This is purely behind-the-scenes cleanup: you, as a reader, would notice it only if you browsed the repository and looked for a folder named \"test\" to inspect sample data (it is gone). No features, behavior, or customer access changed; it is housekeeping that does not affect anything running today. The deletion was flagged as notable internally, but it has no visible effect on the product.",
