        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "Remove unproductive loop detection from main prompt",
        "summary": "Removed `checkForUnproductiveLoop` import and associated logic in `backend/src/main-prompt.ts`. The code previously checked for consecutive assistant messages without `end_turn` calls and forced termination if a loop was detected. This mechanism is now disabled.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T13:20:12.358Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant can no longer automatically stop itself if it notices you've sent it more than two messages in a row without pausing. Previously, after you sent a third consecutive message without the assistant saying it was done, it would check whether it was stuck in a loop and end the conversation early. That safety check has been removed, so the assistant will continue responding until you stop sending messages or it runs out of things to try.",
        "model": "vyce/deepseek-v4.1",
        "v": 4,
        "src": "017747319eca",
        "at": "2026-09-17T23:38:32.545Z"
